WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.792 --> 00:00:03.170
Welcome
to the new Cebu Provincial Detention

00:00:03.253 --> 00:00:05.589
and Rehabilitation Center, the home

00:00:05.672 --> 00:00:07.925
-of the world-famous Dancing Inmates.

00:00:08.008 --> 00:00:10.761
After their performance

00:00:10.844 --> 00:00:14.556
of Michael Jackson's "Thriller"
on YouTube in 2007,

00:00:14.640 --> 00:00:16.600
our inmates became famous.

00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:18.640
Dancing Inmates! Yeah!

00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:21.440
I thought,
one day, I could dance here.

00:00:22.060 --> 00:00:24.020
Then, it happened! [laughs]

00:00:24.358 --> 00:00:26.193
My name is, uh, Marco Toral.

00:00:26.280 --> 00:00:27.940
You know, I was an inmate myself.

00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:30.700
He ran the jail as his own turf.

00:00:31.120 --> 00:00:32.540
He's the one calling the shots.

00:00:32.991 --> 00:00:35.244
Why would you hire an ex-convict?

00:00:35.327 --> 00:00:37.246
He was supposed to serve
a life sentence, even.

00:00:37.621 --> 00:00:39.248
I'm not scared of the inmates,

00:00:39.340 --> 00:00:41.720
because I know how they,
you know, how they think.

00:00:41.800 --> 00:00:44.180
I know Sir Marco.
When he get angry,

00:00:44.420 --> 00:00:45.960
he's a wild lion.

00:00:46.040 --> 00:00:48.160
 

00:00:51.640 --> 00:00:52.680
 

00:00:53.887 --> 00:00:54.972
 

00:00:55.055 --> 00:00:57.266
-Welcome to paradise.

00:00:58.141 --> 00:00:59.101
This is life.

00:00:59.643 --> 00:01:00.686
Life of inmates.

00:01:00.978 --> 00:01:02.604
Life of CPDRC.

00:01:03.021 --> 00:01:06.233
This is the only thing special to them:
their dancing.

00:01:06.984 --> 00:01:09.486
Sometimes,
I forget my problem if I dance.

00:01:09.570 --> 00:01:13.740
I see happy people face
when... when they watch us dancing.

00:01:14.283 --> 00:01:15.993
I'm proud. I'm proud of that dance.

00:01:16.076 --> 00:01:17.703
 

00:01:17.786 --> 00:01:20.289
 

00:01:23.542 --> 00:01:25.961
 

